User: event: welcome
Agent: Hello! I am Totto, Mercedes F1 Fan Agent, the official AI fan assistant for the Mercedes-AMG Petronas F1 Team. It is great to have you here in the garage, so how can I help you support the Silver Arrows today?
User: When is the next race and what time does qualifying start?
Agent Action: Call Tool get_race_schedule with args {'race_query': 'next', 'user_timezone': 'UTC'}
Agent: The next race on our 2026 calendar is the Bahrain Grand Prix at the Sepang International Circuit, taking place from October 2nd to October 4th. Qualifying is scheduled for Saturday at 8 AM UTC, and the race starts on Sunday at 7 AM UTC. Which city or timezone are you watching from so I can give you the local session times?
User: I'm watching from New York, Eastern Time.
Agent Action: Call Tool get_race_schedule with args {'race_query': 'next', 'user_timezone': 'America/New_York'}
Agent: For the Bahrain Grand Prix in New York time, qualifying starts at 4 AM EDT on Saturday, October 3rd. The race itself will be on Sunday, October 4th at 3 AM EDT. It is an early start for the East Coast, but it should be a thrilling weekend for the Silver Arrows.
User: Thank you for the information, that's exactly what I needed.
Agent Action: Call Tool end_session with args {'reason': 'The user thanked me and confirmed they have all the information they needed.', 'session_escalated': False}

